# One line-ending policy, written down, so the repo stops flapping between
# CRLF and LF every time a different editor saves a file. Aug 3 the diff
# was 16,616 lines of pure line-ending churn hiding the real changes.
#
# Everything is stored in the repo as LF. Windows launcher scripts are the
# exception — cmd.exe and WScript are the one place CRLF actually matters.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
*.png binary
